    <node id="objectivity">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">010944eb5a65c63f39e80f97355e16894267a8d8</data>
      <data key="d2">0.0006583278472679394</data>
      <data key="d3">0.0</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="algorithms" id="0">
      <data key="d4">USES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.8</data>
      <data key="d6">00f754891bd6958896591f7d89cc7805b3e8210a</data>
      <data key="d7">2020</data>
      <data key="d8">Although several algorithms from Explainable Artificial Intelligence have recently been published,</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="algorithms" id="1">
      <data key="d4">USES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.8</data>
      <data key="d6">0250e180a60e8a55361214969c1967a886801c13</data>
      <data key="d7">2021</data>
      <data key="d8">We then present a categorisation of explanatory capabilities and requirements that aims to help users and developers alike to ensure an appropriate match between the types of explanations that a given application requires, and the capabilities of various underlying AI techniques.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="Previous studies" id="0">
      <data key="d4">EXTENDS</data>
      <data key="d5">0.6</data>
      <data key="d6">00f754891bd6958896591f7d89cc7805b3e8210a</data>
      <data key="d7">2020</data>
      <data key="d8">Building on previous studies where models were trained to predict both the holistic and rubric scores of essays,</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="artificial supplementation of human creativity" id="0">
      <data key="d4">ADDRESSES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.6</data>
      <data key="d6">00f754891bd6958896591f7d89cc7805b3e8210a</data>
      <data key="d7">2020</data>
      <data key="d8">Automated essay scoring (AES) is a compelling topic in Learning Analytics for the primary reason that recent advances in AI find it as a good testbed to explore artificial supplementation of human creativity.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="natural language processing" id="0">
      <data key="d4">EXTENDS</data>
      <data key="d5">0.6</data>
      <data key="d6">00f754891bd6958896591f7d89cc7805b3e8210a</data>
      <data key="d7">2020</data>
      <data key="d8">It leverages the state-of-the-art in natural language processing,</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Explainable AI" target="intraoperative adverse events" id="0">
      <data key="d4">ADDRESSES</data>
