      <data key="d4">EVALUATES_ON</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
      <data key="d6">02b041767d7dc172514a0150432920b31075bf4d</data>
      <data key="d7">2024</data>
      <data key="d8">We use it to evaluate the performance of a range of ML models: tree-based models, logistic regression, support vector machines, and neural networks.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Machine Learning and Explainable AI Framework" target="ML practices" id="0">
      <data key="d4">COMBINES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.8</data>
      <data key="d6">02b041767d7dc172514a0150432920b31075bf4d</data>
      <data key="d7">2024</data>
      <data key="d8">This framework combines a series of ML practices designed to handle the scarcity and imbalance of catalyst data.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Layer-wise Relevance Propagation" target="Class-aware explanations" id="0">
      <data key="d4">PRODUCES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
      <data key="d6">02b041767d7dc172514a0150432920b31075bf4d</data>
      <data key="d7">2024</data>
      <data key="d8">XAI methods, providing class-aware explanations, such as Layer-wise Relevance Propagation, identified key components that contribute specifically to high-yield catalysts.</data>
    </edge>
