    <edge source="GCNNMMA" target="GNNs and CNNs" id="0">
      <data key="d4">COMBINES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.8</data>
      <data key="d6">00661ab418a4abd3ed58696ac839125a58e919f9</data>
      <data key="d7">2023</data>
      <data key="d8">We integrate graph neural networks (GNNs) and convolutional neural networks (CNNs) to propose a miRNA and small molecule association prediction model (GCNNMMA).</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GCNNMMA" target="black-box effect of deep learning models" id="0">
      <data key="d4">ADDRESSES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.7</data>
      <data key="d6">00661ab418a4abd3ed58696ac839125a58e919f9</data>
      <data key="d7">2023</data>
      <data key="d8">Since the black-box effect of deep learning models makes them difficult to analyze and interpret, we introduce attention mechanisms to address this issue.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GCNNMMA" target="black-box effect of deep learning models" id="1">
      <data key="d4">ADDRESSES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.7</data>
      <data key="d6">00661ab418a4abd3ed58696ac839125a58e919f9</data>
      <data key="d7">2023</data>
      <data key="d8">Since the black-box effect of deep learning models makes them difficult to analyze and interpret, we introduce attention mechanisms to address this issue.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GCNNMMA" target="association between miRNAs and small molecule drugs" id="0">
      <data key="d4">PRODUCES</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
      <data key="d6">00661ab418a4abd3ed58696ac839125a58e919f9</data>
      <data key="d7">2023</data>
      <data key="d8">The neural attention mechanism allows the CNNs model to learn the sequence data of miRNAs to determine the weight of sub-sequences in miRNAs, and then predict the association between miRNAs and small molecule drugs.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GCNNMMA" target="two datasets" id="0">
      <data key="d4">EVALUATES_ON</data>
      <data key="d5">0.8</data>
