      <data key="d8">Experiments in both offline and online settings on large real-world document collections such as CORD-19, NIPS papers, and Tweet datasets show that, while LDA and DTM is a good model for discovering word-level topics, ITMWE discovers better document-level topic groups more efficiently in a dynamic environment, which is crucial in text mining applications.</data>
