      <data key="d8">The proposed ALL-Net outperformed EfficientNet, MobileNetV3, VGG-19, Xception, InceptionV3, ResNet50V2, VGG-16, and NASNetLarge except for DenseNet201 with a slight variation of 0.5%.</data>
